OL,3,AFrom Paris to DC - why offices are
OL,4,Abeing turned into apartments
OL,5,
OL,6,FGroupama Immobilier intends to convert
OL,7,Fthe entire building into apartments. It
OL,8,Fshould be the first of many such
OL,9,Foffice-to-apartments conversions in the
OL,10,Fsurrounding area.
